            "name": "Dungeon Nightmares II : The Memory",
            "steam_appid": 382090,
            "required_age": "12",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>More Dungeon Nightmares?</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The &quot;Spiritual&quot; successor to the Dungeon Nightmares series</h2><br><br><br>The next game coming from K Monkey has been announced! Please add to your wishlist for updates.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Dungeon Nightmares II is a first-person <strong>psychological horror</strong> that takes you through a journey of discovering what nightmares are.<br><br>The game is inspired by classic <strong>roguelike</strong> games which include <strong>100% procedural-generated maps</strong> and <strong>permadeath</strong>. These features play an important part in making this game tense with the feeling of dread &amp; terror as you walk the hallways of the dungeon.<br><br>Every time you play, the dungeons are randomised which guarantees unlimited replay value.<br><br>The game is simple. Get through each dungeon by surviving the horrors that lurk deep within and making your way to the exit.<br><br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense scary atmosphere<br></li><li>Combat-less gameplay<br></li><li>100% procedural-generated maps<br></li><li>Permadeath<br></li><li>Rich 3D surround sound<br></li><li>Intelligent AI that changes based on the way you behave each night<br></li><li>Unlockable extras</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Dungeon Nightmares II is a first-person <strong>psychological horror</strong> that takes you through a journey of discovering what nightmares are.<br><br>The game is inspired by classic <strong>roguelike</strong> games which include <strong>100% procedural-generated maps</strong> and <strong>permadeath</strong>. These features play an important part in making this game tense with the feeling of dread &amp; terror as you walk the hallways of the dungeon.<br><br>Every time you play, the dungeons are randomised which guarantees unlimited replay value.<br><br>The game is simple. Get through each dungeon by surviving the horrors that lurk deep within and making your way to the exit.<br><br><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense scary atmosphere<br></li><li>Combat-less gameplay<br></li><li>100% procedural-generated maps<br></li><li>Permadeath<br></li><li>Rich 3D surround sound<br></li><li>Intelligent AI that changes based on the way you behave each night<br></li><li>Unlockable extras</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Dungeon Nightmares II is a first-person psychological horror that takes you through a journey of discovering what nightmares are.The game is inspired by classic roguelike games which include 100% procedural-generated maps and permadeath.",
