                        "review": "Scariest game ive ever played. I dont play this game because it is too scary for me and i dont gather enough courage to play it. A very good game. Grade AAA+ for the game developer and a very good job for making this game. I play a lot of horror game and none of them scares me as this game and also this game holds as one of the most extreme scariest games of all time with its atmosphere and its top notch of the timing occasion for monsters to scare you. Not many horror games are scary as this game. \r\n\r\nStrongly recommend for those who wants to be scared and for everyone and yes... even for those who play and played a lot of horror games before and doesnt get scared. YOU will get scared of this game i promise you",
